<title>USA: Schultz Sav-O Q1 April 19 net rises.</title>
<headline>Schultz Sav-O Q1 April 19 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SHEBOYGAN, Wis. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.33		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net			  1,587		    1,261</p>
<p> Revs		     138,826		  134,079</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	   N/A			N/A</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 4,802		    4,831</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said current quarter earnings reflect the success of the Green Bay Packers in the playoffs and Superbowl, its continued electronic card marketing program and the completion of four major franchise locations.</p>
<p>Full name is Schultz Savo-O Stores Inc.</p>
